Changing this file on a branch starts a chain of Infinity LLM learning sessions on that branch
(.github/workflows/infinity-learning.yml). Each session runs the learning worker for up to five hours, stores its
state in the release "infinity-state", and starts the next session.

To stop the chain: set the repository variable INFINITY_LEARNING to "off" (Settings → Secrets and variables →
Actions → Variables), or disable the workflow "Infinity LLM learning" on the Actions page.

